---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import PracticeNav from "../components/PracticeNav.astro";
import PracticeFooter from "../components/PracticeFooter.astro";
import { metrics, whyme, caseStudies, highlights, broughtIn, howIBuild } from "../data/practice";

// The person and the record: bio, the numbers with their context, the two
// league case summaries, four platform and holdco highlights, and why me.

const calendly = "https://calendly.com/adesikan/15min";
const eyebrow = "text-[11px] md:text-xs tracking-[0.22em] uppercase text-[color:var(--color-accent)]";
const sectionLabel = "text-xs md:text-sm tracking-[0.22em] uppercase text-[color:var(--color-muted)]";
const cta = "inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm md:text-base text-[color:var(--color-accent)] hover:text-[color:var(--color-paper)] transition-colors";
const small = "inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs md:text-sm text-[color:var(--color-accent)] hover:text-[color:var(--color-paper)] transition-colors";

const toc = [
  { href: "#bio", label: "Bio" },
  { href: "#impact", label: "Impact at scale" },
  { href: "#fix", label: "Brought in to fix" },
  { href: "#build", label: "How I build" },
  { href: "#leagues", label: "The leagues" },
  { href: "#platforms", label: "Platforms and holdcos" },
  { href: "#why", label: "Why work with me" },
];
---

<Layout
  title="About | Ashwin Desikan, Citizen of Nowhere"
  description="Ashwin Desikan ran data, identity and measurement at the NFL and MLB and the buying side of the same trade at Amazon, Spotify, Digitas and Annalect. The bio, the numbers with their context, and the record."
  path="/about"
>
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 md:px-10 py-16 md:py-28">
    <PracticeNav current="/about" />

    <section id="bio" class="mb-20 md:mb-28 scroll-mt-24">
      <p class={`${eyebrow} mb-8`} style="font-family: var(--font-display)">About</p>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-[220px_1fr] gap-10 items-start">
        <img src="/ashwin-portrait-web.jpg" alt="Ashwin Desikan" class="w-48 md:w-full rounded-sm border border-[color:var(--color-line)]" />
        <div>
          <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl leading-[1.05] tracking-tight font-medium mb-6" style="font-family: var(--font-serif)">
            Ashwin Desikan. Operator in sports, AdTech and identity, <span class="text-[color:var(--color-accent)]">at home in more than one city</span>.
          </h1>
          <div class="space-y-5 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed text-[color:var(--color-paper)]/80 max-w-2xl" style="font-family: var(--font-serif)">
            <p>I hold three passports and have spent my career building the data and identity systems that organizations depend on when they live or die by their audiences. That work has run across the United States, the United Kingdom, and Europe, anchored in the two cities I call home, London and New York. <span class="text-[color:var(--color-accent)]">Citizen of Nowhere</span> is where that orientation becomes public work.</p>
            <p>The arc runs from bioinformatics at Illumina, through London's early AdTech wave, across European markets with the global holding companies, into the platforms that now define the industry at Amazon, Spotify, and Facebook, and on to the major American sports leagues out of New York. The through-line never changed: treat audiences and places as measurable systems, then build the infrastructure and the commercial model to act on them.</p>
            <p>Today I do that in two registers. Commercially, advising and leading on identity, data, and monetization on both sides of the Atlantic. And independently, building indices and writing about movement, measurement, and belonging. The phrase was meant as an insult. I kept it, because someone at home in more than one city, loyal to the idea rather than the flag, is not stateless. They simply see more of the map.</p>
          </div>
          <nav class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-xs md:text-sm" style="font-family: var(--font-display)" aria-label="On this page">
            {toc.slice(1).map((t) => <a href={t.href} class="text-[color:var(--color-muted)] hover:text-[color:var(--color-paper)] transition-colors">{t.label}</a>)}
          </nav>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Brought in to fix, and how I build -->
    <section id="fix" class="mb-20 md:mb-28 scroll-mt-24 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 md:gap-16">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between mb-8 pb-4 border-b border-[color:var(--color-line)]">
          <h2 class={sectionLabel} style="font-family: var(--font-display)">What I am brought in to fix</h2>
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-3">
          {broughtIn.map((b) => (
            <li class="pl-5 relative text-base md:text-lg text-[color:var(--color-paper)]/80 leading-relaxed" style="font-family: var(--font-serif)"><span class="absolute left-0 top-3 h-px w-3 bg-[color:var(--color-accent)]"></span>{b}</li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div id="build" class="scroll-mt-24">
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between mb-8 pb-4 border-b border-[color:var(--color-line)]">
          <h2 class={sectionLabel} style="font-family: var(--font-display)">How I build</h2>
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-5">
          {howIBuild.map((h) => (
            <li>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-[color:var(--color-accent)]" style="font-family: var(--font-serif)">{h.t}</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-[color:var(--color-paper)]/70 leading-relaxed" style="font-family: var(--font-serif)">{h.d}</p>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
        <a href="https://rankings.citizenofnowhere.org/studio/clean-room" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class={`${small} mt-6`} style="font-family: var(--font-display)">See the clean room refuse a query <span aria-hidden="true">-&gt;</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Impact at scale -->
    <section id="impact" class="mb-20 md:mb-28 scroll-mt-24">
      <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between mb-8 pb-4 border-b border-[color:var(--color-line)]">
        <h2 class={sectionLabel} style="font-family: var(--font-display)">Impact at scale</h2>
        <span class="text-xs md:text-sm text-[color:var(--color-muted)]" style="font-family: var(--font-display)">Measured outcomes</span>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-px bg-[color:var(--color-line)] border border-[color:var(--color-line)]">
        {metrics.map((m) => (
          <div class="bg-[color:var(--color-ink)] p-6 md:p-7">
            <p class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-medium tracking-tight text-[color:var(--color-paper)] mb-2" style="font-family: var(--font-serif)">{m.fig}</p>
            <p class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.16em] uppercase text-[color:var(--color-accent)] mb-3" style="font-family: var(--font-display)">{m.label}</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-[color:var(--color-paper)]/70 leading-relaxed" style="font-family: var(--font-serif)">{m.context}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- The leagues -->
    <section id="leagues" class="mb-20 md:mb-28 scroll-mt-24">
      <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between mb-8 pb-4 border-b border-[color:var(--color-line)]">
        <h2 class={sectionLabel} style="font-family: var(--font-display)">The leagues</h2>
        <span class="text-xs md:text-sm text-[color:var(--color-muted)]" style="font-family: var(--font-display)">League scale, in detail</span>
      </div>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-px bg-[color:var(--color-line)] border border-[color:var(--color-line)]">
        {caseStudies.map((c) => (
          <div class="bg-[color:var(--color-ink)] p-7 md:p-8">
            <p class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-[color:var(--color-accent)] mb-2" style="font-family: var(--font-display)">{c.co}</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-[color:var(--color-muted)] mb-5" style="font-family: var(--font-display)">{c.role}</p>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
              {c.points.map((pt) => (
                <li class="pl-5 relative text-sm md:text-base text-[color:var(--color-paper)]/80 leading-relaxed" style="font-family: var(--font-serif)">
                  <span class="absolute left-0 top-2.5 h-px w-3 bg-[color:var(--color-accent)]"></span>{pt}
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
            {c.link && (
              <a href={c.link.href} class={`${small} mt-6`} style="font-family: var(--font-display)">{c.link.label} <span aria-hidden="true">-&gt;</span></a>
            )}
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-x-8 gap-y-2" style="font-family: var(--font-display)">
        <a href="/record" class={small}>What the leagues have said since, on the public record <span aria-hidden="true">-&gt;</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Platforms and holdcos -->
    <section id="platforms" class="mb-20 md:mb-28 scroll-mt-24">
      <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between mb-8 pb-4 border-b border-[color:var(--color-line)]">
        <h2 class={sectionLabel} style="font-family: var(--font-display)">Platforms and holding companies</h2>
        <span class="text-xs md:text-sm text-[color:var(--color-muted)]" style="font-family: var(--font-display)">The other side of the trade</span>
      </div>
      <div class="divide-y divide-[color:var(--color-line)] border-y border-[color:var(--color-line)]">
        {highlights.map((h, i) => (
          <details class="group" open={i === 0}>
            <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden py-5 flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4">
              <span class="text-lg md:text-xl font-medium group-hover:text-[color:var(--color-accent)] transition-colors" style="font-family: var(--font-serif)">{h.title}</span>
              <span class="shrink-0 text-[10px] tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-[color:var(--color-accent)]" style="font-family: var(--font-display)">{h.co}</span>
            </summary>
            <p class="pb-6 text-sm md:text-base text-[color:var(--color-paper)]/75 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl" style="font-family: var(--font-serif)">{h.blurb}</p>
          </details>
        ))}
      </div>
      <div class="mt-6" style="font-family: var(--font-display)">
        <a href="/work" class={small}>The full record of building, from Illumina to the NFL <span aria-hidden="true">-&gt;</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Why work with me -->
    <section id="why" class="mb-20 md:mb-28 scroll-mt-24">
      <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between mb-8 pb-4 border-b border-[color:var(--color-line)]">
        <h2 class={sectionLabel} style="font-family: var(--font-display)">Why work with me</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-px bg-[color:var(--color-line)] border border-[color:var(--color-line)]">
        {whyme.map((w) => (
          <div class="bg-[color:var(--color-ink)] p-7 md:p-8">
            <h3 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-medium mb-3 text-[color:var(--color-accent)]" style="font-family: var(--font-serif)">{w.label}</h3>
            <p class="text-sm md:text-base text-[color:var(--color-paper)]/75 leading-relaxed" style="font-family: var(--font-serif)">{w.body}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-20 md:mb-28 border border-[color:var(--color-line)] p-8 md:p-12">
      <p class={`${eyebrow} mb-5`} style="font-family: var(--font-display)">Currently</p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight mb-6 max-w-3xl leading-snug" style="font-family: var(--font-serif)">
        Open to a senior leadership mandate in data, identity, and marketing technology, the kind that <span class="text-[color:var(--color-accent)]">owns the operating model end to end</span>, with selective advisory alongside. London or New York.
      </h2>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-8 gap-y-3" style="font-family: var(--font-display)">
        <a href={calendly} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class={cta}>Book a 15-minute call <span aria-hidden="true">-&gt;</span></a>
        <a href="/practice#contact" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm md:text-base text-[color:var(--color-muted)] hover:text-[color:var(--color-paper)] transition-colors">Send a note <span aria-hidden="true">-&gt;</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <PracticeFooter />
  </main>
</Layout>
